---
import Photo from "../components/Photo.astro"
import { workshopImage } from "../data/images"
---

<section
  id="about"
  class="bg-background-alt py-section palette-surface-light"
  aria-labelledby="about-heading"
>
  <div
    class="mx-auto grid w-full max-w-landing gap-10 px-container-x sm:px-8 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:items-center xl:px-14"
  >
    <Photo image={workshopImage} ratio="3 / 4" class="reveal" />
    <div class="reveal">
      <p class="text-sm font-bold tracking-widest text-muted uppercase">
        About the collector
      </p>
      <h2
        id="about-heading"
        class="mt-4 max-w-heading font-display text-headline-2 leading-none text-balance uppercase"
      >
        He did not need this many cars.
      </h2>
      <p
        class="mt-4 font-display text-headline-3 leading-none text-foreground/70 uppercase"
      >
        That was never really the point.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-8 space-y-5 text-xl leading-relaxed text-muted">
        <p>
          The archive began with curiosity and became a way of preserving
          mechanical culture: not as museum silence, but as maintenance,
          community, road dust, and the occasional argument about carburetors.
        </p>
        <p>
          Every car is documented, driven, repaired, photographed, and shared
          with people who understand why an old engine starting cleanly can
          change the whole day.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
